 BSE| Energy of last empty index [eV]                                    143.867
 BSE| Energy difference of first occupied index to HOMO [eV]             420.547
 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                 144.263
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                     52
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                       230
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
 BSE|

 *** WARNING in bse_util.F:1622 :: Keyword NUM_PRINT_EXC_DESCR is either ***
